UI_TEXT(TheHookWasInstalledButTheTarget, L"Hook 已安装，但目标进程未在 8 秒内连接监控服务。\n目标消息线程可能未及时处理 Hook，或 DLL 初始化被安全软件阻止。", L"The hook was installed, but the target did not connect within 8 seconds.\nIts message thread may not have processed the hook, or security software may have blocked DLL initialization.")
UI_TEXT(AnOlderHookDLLConnectedButIt, L"目标进程中的旧版 Hook DLL 已连接，但当前规则或剪贴板保护设置需要扩展协议，旧版 DLL无法准确执行。\n\n已拒绝在降级规则下开始保护；请重新启动目标程序以加载支持新格式模型的当前 HookDll.dll，或先关闭“仅允许复制 / 粘贴快捷键”与 Crypto 保护，并改用“任意格式”、仅包含进程条件且不显示通知的放行/阻止兼容规则。", L"An older Hook DLL connected, but it cannot enforce the extended protocol required by the current rules or protection settings.\n\nProtection was not started with reduced rules. Restart the target to load the current HookDll.dll, or disable shortcut-only access and Crypto protection and use compatible allow/block rules with Any format, process conditions only, and no notifications.")
UI_TEXT(TheTargetConnectedWithoutConfirmingTheCurrent, L"目标进程已连接，但没有确认当前监控协议。\n目标中可能仍驻留旧版 Hook DLL，或程序目录混用了不同次构建的文件。\n\n请确认 ClipboardProtector.exe 与 HookDll.dll 来自同一构建目录；如目标在升级前已被注入，请完全退出并重启目标程序后重试。", L"The target connected without confirming the current monitoring protocol.\nIt may still be running an older Hook DLL, or the application directory may contain files from different builds.\n\nUse ClipboardProtector.exe and HookDll.dll from the same build. If the target was injected before upgrading, fully exit and restart it before trying again.")
