UI_TEXT(GlobalInjectionCoversCompatibleDesktopGUIProcesses, L"全局注入会先覆盖兼容的桌面 GUI 进程，并每 2 秒检查一次当前会话中同一用户的新进程；未完成监控初始化的进程将尝试远程初始化 Hook DLL。\n\n启用“仅允许复制 / 粘贴快捷键”后，成功注入的进程中，其他剪贴板 API 访问会被直接拒绝。\n\n该模式可能影响其他程序稳定性，并且尚未完成长时间多进程压力验收。建议仅在带快照的虚拟机中使用。\n\n确定要启用吗？", L"Global injection covers compatible desktop GUI processes and checks for new processes belonging to the same user and session every 2 seconds. It attempts remote Hook DLL initialization for processes that are not ready.\n\nWith shortcut-only access enabled, other clipboard API access is denied in successfully injected processes.\n\nThis mode may affect other applications and has not completed long-term, multi-process stress testing. Use a virtual machine with a snapshot.\n\nEnable protection?")
