UI_TEXT(GlobalInjectionUsesWHGETMESSAGEForCompatible, L"全局注入先使用 WH_GETMESSAGE 覆盖兼容的 GUI 进程；后台巡检每 2 秒比较一次 PID 与创建时间，对超过宽限期仍未 Ready 的同用户进程执行远程初始化。巡检不会为唤醒目标而发送窗口或线程消息。\n\n覆盖限制：关键/受保护进程、部分 UWP/AppContainer，以及被系统或安全软件拒绝远程访问的进程仍可能无法监控；失败会退避重试。\n\n“仅允许复制 / 粘贴快捷键”只约束成功加载 Hook DLL 的进程；未注入进程不受该开关保护。\n\n关闭全局注入时，程序会先停止巡检，再通知已连接 DLL 进入 fail-open、解除 Detours 并完成调用清退，最后卸载系统 Hook 和远程加载引用。", L"Global injection uses WH_GETMESSAGE for compatible GUI processes. Every 2 seconds, the coverage monitor compares process IDs and creation times and remotely initializes same-user processes that remain unready beyond the grace period. It does not send window or thread messages to wake targets.\n\nCoverage limits: critical/protected processes, some UWP/AppContainer applications, and processes that deny remote access may remain unmonitored. Failed attempts use retry backoff.\n\nShortcut-only access applies only to processes that successfully loaded the Hook DLL. Uninjected processes are not protected by this option.\n\nWhen global injection is disabled, the application stops the coverage monitor, asks connected DLLs to allow access, removes Detours and drains active calls, then releases system hooks and remote load references.")
